'''Caluyanon''' is a [[regional language|regional]] Western [[Bisayan languages|Bisayan language]] spoken in the Semirara Island Group, [[Caluya, Antique|Caluya]], [[Antique Province|Antique]] in the [[Philippines]]. Most of its speakers use either [[Kinaray-a language|Kinaray-a]] or [[Hiligaynon language|Hiligaynon]] as their second language.

